  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "將最棒的穿搭！\n呈獻給您！<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 180,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C07670068D276847A7F642DFF01000A5448737B7D6660A8FF0100100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我是世界級的\n穿搭顧問！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƑ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 236,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211662F4E16754C7D1A7684000A7A7F642D9867554FFF0100100002011401910000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "而這樣的我\n目前關注的……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƑ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "800C90196A2376846211000A76EE524D95DC6CE876842026202600100002011401910000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "就是您！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƑ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 308,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C31662F60A8FF0100100002011401910000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "就讓我擅自慶祝這場相遇，\n為您設計一套全身穿搭！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƑ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 328,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C318B93621164C581EA6176795D9019583476F89047FF0C000A70BA60A88A2D8A084E00595751688EAB7A7F642DFF0100100002011401910000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "請儘管放心。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n時尚單品會出借給您，\n而且不會和您收取費用！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƑ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 388,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8ACB51187BA1653E5FC3300200100001BE01000A66425C1A55AE54C1670351FA501F7D6660A8FF0C000A800C4E144E0D6703548C60A8653653D68CBB7528FF0100100002011401910000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "事情就是這樣……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƑ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 464,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E8B60C55C31662F90196A232026202600100002011401910000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我會為您設計一套\n全身穿搭！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƑ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 492,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211670370BA60A88A2D8A084E005957000A51688EAB7A7F642DFF0100100002011401910000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "拜託了",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 532,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62DC8A174E860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "還是算了",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 540,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9084662F7B974E860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哎呀……由他人來選擇才能發現的可能性，\n您居然連試一下都不想嗎……！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƑ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 552,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54CE54402026202675314ED64EBA4F86907864C7624D80FD767C73FE768453EF80FD6027FF0C000A60A85C45713690238A664E004E0B90FD4E0D60F355CE20262026FF0100100002011401910000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "有一件事要請您注意。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n您可以自由地換裝，\n但屆時必須要歸還穿搭的服飾。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n這樣您也沒問題嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƑ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 632,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "67094E004EF64E8B89818ACB60A86CE8610F300200100001BE01000A60A853EF4EE581EA7531573063DB88DDFF0C000A4F465C4666425FC5980889816B7890847A7F642D7684670D98FE300200100001BE00000A90196A2360A84E5F6C92554F984C55CEFF1F00100002011401910000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我明白了",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 744,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211660E767D4E860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "還是算了",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 756,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9084662F7B974E860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "OK！就讓我將最棒的穿搭！\n呈獻給您！！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƑ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 768,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F004BFF015C318B9362115C07670068D276847A7F642DFF01000A5448737B7D6660A8FF01FF0100100002011401910000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不愧是我的搭配！\n現在您在密阿雷可是獨一無二！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƑ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 820,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D6127662F62117684642D914DFF01000A73FE572860A857285BC6963F96F753EF662F73684E0071214E8CFF0100100002011401910000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那麼請好好享受這套穿搭\n直到明天早上吧。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n如果有機會再碰面，和我打聲招呼喔。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƑ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 876,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A39EBC8ACB597D597D4EAB53D7901959577A7F642D000A76F45230660E592965E94E0A5427300200100001BE01000A5982679C67096A5F6703518D78B09762FF0C548C62116253807262DB547C5594300200100002011401910000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要歸還借用的服飾嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƑ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 968,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "89816B789084501F75287684670D98FE55CEFF1F00100002011401910000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "歸還",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1000,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6B7890840000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不歸還",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1008,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D6B7890840000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如果不歸還借用的服飾，\n就無法購買新的衣物。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1016,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5982679C4E0D6B789084501F75287684670D98FEFF0C000A5C3171216CD58CFC8CB765B076848863726930020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "1天只能委託我設計1次穿搭！\n如果想再委託的話得等到明天才行！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƑ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
